WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:01.126
- It’s O’Neal and Bryant.

00:00:01.126 --> 00:00:04.879
Their ability to work together is the 
linchpin of any hopes the Lakers have.

00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:07.799
- Shaq and the Lakers, they’re swept out of the playoffs.

00:00:07.799 --> 00:00:09.384
- Kobe Bryant, Shaquille O’Neal.

00:00:09.384 --> 00:00:10.844
- Are the Lakers running out of time?

00:00:10.885 --> 00:00:13.430
- Shaq better get comfortable
because Kobe’s not gonna change.

00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:14.931
- [Kobe Bryant:] All that stuff is old.

00:00:14.931 --> 00:00:17.517
You know, people just wanna keep on talking about it
and dragging him in the mud.

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:19.102
- [Shaquille O’Neal:] Really don’t have to be buddy-buddy.

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:21.563
- [Phil Jackson:] At some level, somebody’s will has to give.

00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:24.065
- [Bryant:] We have to win. There’s no other option.

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:35.785
- [O’Neal:] We were up 3-1. We got cute a lotta times.
We let our guards down.

00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:39.164
- That aura of invincibility has been pierced big-time.

00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:41.958
- This sets up an unbelievable Game 7.

00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:45.378
- [O’Neal:] They were the toughest team, and
they were the only team that wasn’t scared of us.

00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:51.509
So, for me, I was kinda nervous,
but I knew that I had to come out and play well,
which didn’t happen.

00:00:51.593 --> 00:00:54.220
I didn’t have one of those Shaq-like games at all.

00:00:54.304 --> 00:00:56.306
- Still no Shaquille O’Neal for the Lakers.

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:58.558
- This is a 15-point game.

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:00.643
- This crowd is stunned.

00:01:00.685 --> 00:01:04.272
- [O’Neal:] Now, for us, in our head, we got tired of failing.

00:01:04.272 --> 00:01:10.153
And if we don’t get this one, just be another,
“Oh, they had a good year, but, you know, they failed.”

00:01:10.278 --> 00:01:16.326
I know I definitely would have been the scapegoat
if we didn’t win that game, and I probably would have
been gone right away.

00:01:16.659 --> 00:01:21.039
I was scared, scared of that
if we didn’t get it done, it’ll be over.

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:25.627
Kobe vs. Shaq feud thing gonna come up.
I just let everybody down.

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:30.090
Then in the fourth quarter, I got rollin’ a little bit.
I hit one off the glass.

00:01:30.173 --> 00:01:33.176
- They get it deep to Shaq, and he connects off the glass.

00:01:33.176 --> 00:01:36.596
- [O’Neal:] But I kept telling Kob,
“Hey, I’m wide open at the rim.”

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:38.348
And he said, “I gotcha. I gotcha.”

00:01:39.516 --> 00:01:47.273
The last play, I wasn’t even lookin’ for the ball cuz I was
like, “OK, Kobe gonna shoot in the fourth quarter.
Get it to Kobe and just get out the way.”

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:50.401
So he got it, and he crossed Scottie Pippen up.

00:01:51.903 --> 00:01:55.323
And [Brian] Grant left me, and I just threw my hand up.

00:01:55.573 --> 00:01:57.992
I almost didn’t jump
cuz I didn’t think he was gonna throw it.

00:01:57.992 --> 00:02:01.996
But when he threw it up, I said,
“Oh, shit, this is not a shot.”

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:05.250
So I had to get up, and he actually threw it up too high.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:08.419
If I’d have jumped a second later or jumped too early,
I’d have missed it.

00:02:10.088 --> 00:02:12.298
And I didn’t wanna take a chance bein’ cute.

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:13.424
- To Shaq!

00:02:14.843 --> 00:02:16.511
- [O’Neal:] I just threw it through real quick.

00:02:16.553 --> 00:02:20.056
That was the defining moment
of our, of our dominant run.

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:23.726
But that was, you know, the beginning of the, 
of the great Laker three-peat.

00:02:23.726 --> 00:02:30.900
And that solidified us being the most enigmatic,
most controversial, most dominant
one-two punch ever created.

00:02:32.152 --> 00:02:34.779
People always ask about our relationship.

00:02:34.904 --> 00:02:38.366
You got two strong-minded people
that are gonna get it done their way.

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:40.368
The respect will never be lost.

00:02:40.368 --> 00:02:46.166
But when it comes to be inside the lines and win, 
that’s what me and him, that’s what we did.

